  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of services for the Zambia Poverty Reduction Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK/Zambia Poverty Reduction Program (ZPRP) aims to catalyse and lock in new approaches to sustainable poverty reduction in Zambia. It will build on decades of UK support for social protection, and broader human development support including nutrition, adolescent and sexual reproductive health, and education. It will also harness new political commitment to decentralisation to strengthen systems of service delivery and shift the politics of development towards greater accountability and responsiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
